# AMBIENT HUB CHATTER — speech bubbles while the player roams.
# Members only. 2–4 lines per scene, <= 12 words per line. No commands, no menus.
# amb_a1_*  = Act I (before the doors)
# amb_a2e_* = Act II early (0–3 rooms done)
# amb_a2l_* = Act II late (4–7 rooms done; after interlude_2, before or after interlude_3)
# Never refer to a specific room's contents: rooms are done in any order.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ Act I

=== amb_a1_claw
daniel: This claw machine is rigged. I can feel it.
justin: You've lost three times.
daniel: Four. Don't round down to be nice.

=== amb_a1_charger
charlie: Does anyone have a charger? I'm at nine percent.
hanbi: Here.
charlie: Why do you always have one?

=== amb_a1_schedule
songha: We have until five. I'm making a timetable.
hyunjun: Can the timetable have snacks in it?
songha: Snacks are slot three.

=== amb_a1_crackers
hyunjun: Where did my crackers go?
justin: What crackers?
hyunjun: The ones in your hand, Justin.

=== amb_a1_turn
justin: Hyunjun. The turn from last week. Watch.
hyunjun: You're half a count late.
justin: On purpose. It's called style.

=== amb_a1_wall
charlie: Wait, what's happening? Why is the wall glowing?
daniel: It's been glowing for twenty minutes.
charlie: Well, nobody told me.

=== amb_a1_coat
hamin: Hanbi, your coat's still wet.
hanbi: It's fine.
hamin: Put it on the radiator. Please.

=== amb_a1_ramen
daniel: Haruta. Favourite ramen. Go.
haruta: Anything is fine.
daniel: That's not a ramen.

=== amb_a1_flyer
haruta: This flyer is for a film night. Eight years ago.
songha: Someone should really take it down.
haruta: I think it's nice that nobody did.

=== amb_a1_speakers
songha: If it's a speaker array, where are the speakers?
daniel: Maybe the building's just like that.
songha: Buildings are not "just like that."

=== amb_a1_selfie
daniel: Everyone look mysterious. It's for the atmosphere.
charlie: I can't look mysterious. My face won't do it.
daniel: Try looking hungry. Basically the same.

=== amb_a1_sofa
hyunjun: This sofa has a spring that bites.
hamin: Sit on the left side.
hyunjun: How do you already know that?

=== amb_a1_rain
charlie: It's really pouring out there.
justin: Good. Now nobody can leave.
hanbi: Anyone can leave. Nobody wants to.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ Act II early

=== amb_a2e_hum
hyunjun: Can anyone else hear the doors humming?
songha: It's the lights. Probably.
hyunjun: You said "probably." You never say "probably."

=== amb_a2e_diagnostic
songha: ECHO, run a diagnostic, please.
songha: …It said "no, thank you."
daniel: Polite building. I keep saying it.

=== amb_a2e_hungry
hanbi: Is anyone hungry?
hamin: You are. You just haven't noticed yet.
hanbi: …Maybe a little.

=== amb_a2e_claw
daniel: Round five. I've studied the claw. It has patterns.
charlie: It just picked up nothing again.
daniel: That's a pattern.

=== amb_a2e_premiss
charlie: Is it weird that I miss ECHO already?
justin: It hasn't gone anywhere.
charlie: I'm pre-missing it. It's efficient.

=== amb_a2e_stairs
haruta: The third stair from the top creaks.
hamin: The fifth one does too.
haruta: We should warn Daniel. He jumps them.

=== amb_a2e_eightcount
justin: Hyunjun. Eight-count. With me.
hyunjun: Right now? In the lobby?
justin: The lobby has the best floor in the building.

=== amb_a2e_rule
songha: I've written "rule one" on every page.
hanbi: Why?
songha: So I never forget it's the rule.

=== amb_a2e_pocket
justin: Your pocket is crinkling.
hyunjun: No it isn't.
justin: It's crinkling in the exact shape of jelly.

=== amb_a2e_quiet
daniel: Why is everyone so quiet?
hanbi: It's okay to be quiet sometimes.
daniel: …I'm trying it. It's really hard.

=== amb_a2e_upstairs
charlie: Wait, what's happening? Is someone going upstairs?
songha: Not right now.
charlie: Okay. But tell me first next time.

=== amb_a2e_tea
hamin: The kettle in the lounge still works.
haruta: Would anyone like tea?
songha: Everyone. Everyone would like tea.

=== amb_a2e_strawberry
hyunjun: My hair looks like a wet strawberry.
charlie: It looks nice!
hyunjun: A nice wet strawberry.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ Act II late

=== amb_a2l_fort
charlie: Nobody touch the fort. The fort has rules.
daniel: What are the rules?
charlie: Unclear. But very serious.

=== amb_a2l_ghost
hyunjun: The ghost just yawned.
songha: Ghosts don't yawn.
hyunjun: Then not a ghost. Case closed.

=== amb_a2l_floor
justin: If I lie down, I'm not getting up.
hyunjun: So lie down.
justin: …Okay. I live here now.

=== amb_a2l_behind
songha: We're forty minutes behind schedule.
hanbi: There is no schedule.
songha: …There's a small schedule.

=== amb_a2l_shoes
hyunjun: I've started hiding snacks in my shoes.
justin: I know. I checked.
hyunjun: You *checked*?

=== amb_a2l_plugged
charlie: Hanbi. Charger. Again. Sorry.
hanbi: It's already plugged in. By your hand.
charlie: When did you— thank you.

=== amb_a2l_note
hamin: I keep thinking about her library note.
songha: The bossy one?
hamin: I'd like to be that sure about anything.

=== amb_a2l_touched
daniel: I almost had it. The claw touched it.
justin: Touching isn't winning.
daniel: Touching is emotionally winning.

=== amb_a2l_card
hyunjun: One card. Just one. That's so small.
hanbi: We'll figure it out.
hyunjun: Later. I know. Later.

=== amb_a2l_hour
haruta: It's so quiet at this hour.
hamin: The vending machine's the loudest thing now.
haruta: Like a film, just before the music starts.

=== amb_a2l_lying
charlie: Wait, what's happening? Why is everyone lying down?
daniel: It's nearly three. This is what three looks like.
charlie: Oh. Okay. Budge up.

=== amb_a2l_fiveminutes
daniel: I haven't talked for five whole minutes.
songha: I noticed. It was nice.
daniel: …It was, actually.

=== amb_a2l_goodnight
songha: ECHO just said "goodnight" to the vending machine.
hanbi: That's sweet.
songha: That's a bug. …It's sweet.
